
📩 **Spam Email Detection using GRU**

I’m excited to share one of my latest NLP projects: a **Spam Email Detection system using Word2Vec and GRU**.

In this project, I built and compared:

🔹 **TF-IDF + Logistic Regression** as a baseline
🔹 **Word2Vec + GRU** for sequence-based text classification

The final GRU model achieved:

📊 **98.74% Test Accuracy**
🎯 **0.95 F1-score for Spam**
📈 **0.99 Precision for Spam**
🔍 **0.91 Recall for Spam**

I also performed **threshold tuning** to improve the model's classification behavior and selected a threshold of **0.16** based on validation F1-score.

The project is deployed as an interactive **Streamlit application**, where users can enter a message and get a Spam/Ham prediction.

